y chilled and have it  summertime but it's a beautiful bold  wine  but it's not heavy it's got structure  it's rich  so that's what you like  [Music]  if you want to see our black excellence  video on why courage is the key to life  check it out right there next to me i  think you'll love it  continue to believe and i'll see you  there do not make any decisions based on  money  none it's the worst way to make a  decision there's no  substitute for becoming an expert and  being the best at your craft
 

